            "name": "Classic Pain au Chocolat",
            "short_description": "A French classic. Layers of buttery, flaky pastry wrapped around two sticks of rich, dark Belgian chocolate. Best enjoyed warm.",
            "description": "<p>Our Classic Pain au Chocolat is a labor of love. We use high-fat European butter to laminate our dough, creating hundreds of distinct layers that puff up beautifully in the oven.</p><p>Inside, you will find rich, semi-sweet Belgian chocolate that melts slightly when warmed, providing a decadent contrast to the crisp, airy pastry. This is the ultimate breakfast treat or afternoon pick-me-up.</p><p><strong>Heating Instructions:</strong> For the best experience, warm in an oven at 180°C for 3 minutes before eating.</p>",
